# ── Global game leaderboard (Upstash Redis) ──
# Create a free database at https://upstash.com (or Vercel Marketplace → Upstash Redis)
# and copy the two REST credentials below. `@upstash/redis` reads these at runtime.
#
# Supported spellings (pick ONE set; HIGH_SCORE_ prefixes are for namespacing
# multiple integrations in one project):
#
#   UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
#   UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
#
#   # legacy Vercel KV naming
#   KV_REST_API_URL=
#   KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
#
#   # namespaced variant
#   HIGH_SCORE_KV_REST_API_URL=
#   HIGH_SCORE_KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
#
# Required. The leaderboard API returns 500 until both are set.
